# Root ignore list. Prettier reads only the `.prettierignore` next to the
# directory it runs from, and the root run (`pnpm format:check`) covers the whole
# repository, so every generated path has to be listed here.
node_modules
dist
build
.next
coverage
next-env.d.ts
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Markdown is written by hand and reviewed as prose. Prettier realigns every
# table cell (its CJK width math disagrees with the source) and reformats the
# fenced code samples, which rewrites documentation instead of formatting it.
*.md
